The paper’s opening already changes the triage materially: it proves FPT algorithms for both the favorite’s in-degree and out-degree, so neither may stay small in shipped instances. I’m now reading the theorem statements and algorithms to determine whether a planted full seeding remains a defensible hard witness family.
