The tighter construction also failed a stronger, construction-aware attack: the planted opponent’s exact non-favorite out-degree revealed its intended round, after which randomized subtree assembly solved 20/20 instances. I’m removing that signature by equalizing those degrees with indistinguishable decoy wins, then sweeping the resulting feasibility window before deciding whether this family is salvageable.
